/*
 * Zephyr's rpi_5 takes zephyr,sram from the SoC's sram0
 * (dts/arm64/broadcom/bcm2712.dtsi: 512 KiB at 0x200000, two address cells).
 * The probe's GPU buffers (page table, lists, tile memory, target) are statics,
 * so sram0 is the 32 MiB from 0x200000 every Pi 5 image has
 * (tools/probes/rpi_5/rpi5_hello): low, below 4 GiB, so the V3D's page table
 * entries and the mailbox's buffer address fit (pre-study-rpi5.md, U10).
 * Zephyr's own mailbox driver (mbox0) stays disabled, as bcm2712.dtsi has it:
 * the board layer's rpi_mbox.c owns the mailbox.
 * Nothing in this overlay was run.
 */
&sram0 {
	reg = <0x0 0x200000 0x2000000>;
};
